      "**UPSC Examinations:** Reservation in Civil Services (IAS, IPS, IFS) — 15% for SCs, 7.5% for STs, 27% for OBCs, and 10% for EWS — is implemented under Article 16(4).",
      "**Promotion Reservations for SCs/STs:** Under Article 16(4A), SC/ST employees are given reservation in promotions in government services, subject to conditions laid down in Nagaraj.",
